<view class="container">
  <view class="header-section">
    <view class="header-content">
      <text class="header-title">选择关卡</text>
      <text class="header-subtitle">探索六大古代物理主题</text>
    </view>
    <view class="progress-overview">
      <view class="progress-circle">
        <text class="progress-value">{{completedCount}}</text>
        <text class="progress-label">已完成</text>
      </view>
      <view class="progress-info">
        <text class="progress-text">总进度 {{progressPercent}}%</text>
        <view class="progress-bar-mini">
          <view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{progressPercent}}%"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="levels-grid">
    <view class="level-card {{item.completed ? 'completed' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{levels}}"
          wx:key="id"
          bindtap="goToLevel"
          data-level="{{item}}">
      <view class="level-icon-wrapper">
        <text class="level-icon">{{item.icon}}</text>
        <view class="level-number">{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view class="level-badge" wx:if="{{item.completed}}">✓</view>
      </view>
      
      <view class="level-content">
        <view class="level-header">
          <text class="level-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <view class="difficulty-tag" style="background-color: {{getDifficultyColor(item.difficulty)}}">
            {{item.difficulty}}
          </view>
        </view>
        
        <text class="level-description">{{item.description}}</text>
        
        <view class="level-meta">
          <view class="meta-item">
            <text class="meta-icon">⏱</text>
            <text class="meta-text">{{item.duration}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="meta-item" wx:if="{{item.score > 0}}">
            <text class="meta-icon">⭐</text>
            <text class="meta-text">{{item.score}}分</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="level-scene">
          <text class="scene-icon">📍</text>
          <text class="scene-text">{{item.scene}}</text>
        </view>

        <view class="level-action">
          <text class="action-text">{{item.completed ? '再次挑战' : '开始挑战'}}</text>
          <text class="action-arrow">→</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="ancient-decoration">
        <text class="pattern">☯</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tips-card">
    <view class="tips-header">
      <text class="tips-icon">💡</text>
      <text class="tips-title">游戏提示</text>
    </view>
    <text class="tips-text">
      每个关卡都包含古代物理原理的学习和互动答题。完成后可获得积分和徽章，还能解锁知识卡片。
    </text>
  </view>
</view>
